# 2026-10-21 (by addition): the cut has run; `date-released` is 2026-10-21, the day planned for the tag v0.4.0a1, and it replaces the
# statement above that it stays the date of the v0.3.0 tag until the cut. The operator may move it if the tag is cut on another day.
# 2026-10-21 (by addition): `version` became 0.4.0a2, the next pre-release of the v0.4 line (operator decision of 2026-10-21: PyPI starts with
